---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Support | Fate Apothecary"
  description="Support Fate Apothecary and help us keep sharing recipes, herbs, garden notes, and practical knowledge."
>
  <section class="simple-page shell">

    <p class="eyebrow">Support Fate Apothecary</p>

    <h1>Help us keep this little thing growing.</h1>

    <p>
      Fate Apothecary is our little corner of the internet for the things we
      actually cook, grow, use, learn, and love.
    </p>

    <p>
      We want the useful stuff here to stay useful—and readily available.
      Recipes, herb information, garden notes, kitchen knowledge...none of it
      should require a subscription just because you wanted to know how to
      make dinner.
    </p>

    <p>
      If Fate has helped you make something delicious, grow something new,
      learn something useful, or simply made your day a little easier, and
      you’d like to help us keep it growing, you can toss a few dollars in the jar.
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>
        There’s absolutely no pressure. We’re just glad you’re here.
      </strong>
    </p>

    <p>
      <a
        class="button"
        href="https://square.link/u/RaT4jsC0"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer"
      >
        Support Fate Apothecary
      </a>
    </p>

    <div class="about-note">
      <p>Every little bit helps cover the boring stuff behind the scenes—and
      occasionally gives us an excellent excuse to make another batch
      “for research.”
    </p>

    <p>
      Support is completely optional and is not tax-deductible.
      Payments are securely processed by Square.
    </p>

  </section>
</Base>
